msgctxt "80"
msgid "Hey. I take it you're the schmuck who picked up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "92"
msgid "And you're the guys who called?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid "Hand over whatever you bought."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid "What about what you took from me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid ""
"Don't know what you're talking about. We just heard some chump was coming "
"with a lot of valuables on him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid "Some chump?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid ""
"If you ain't gonna hand it over nicely, we're just gonna have to pry it off "
"ya!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid "Ngh... *cough*... He never said you'd be so tough..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "188"
msgid "What do you mean, \"he never said\"? Who's giving you instructions?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "200"
msgid ""
"Our boss... He calls the marks and sends 'em over here, and we pick 'em up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "212"
msgid ""
"He makes random calls to pay phones and tells whoever answers he has "
"\"something important\" of theirs."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "224"
msgid ""
"Anybody stupid enough to believe him, boss has 'em buy things around town. "
"Then we take it off of 'em."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "236"
msgid "So, when he said he took something important from me...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "248"
msgid ""
"Never existed. He just makes it all up. Whoever believes him winds up here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "260"
msgid "That's a cruel scam. Where's this boss of yours?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "272"
msgid ""
"Hell if I know! Probably figured out what happened already. I bet he skipped"
" town!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "284"
msgid "By now? He's long gone. Heheheh..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "296"
msgid "And so are we!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "332"
msgid ""
"Looks like they were pretty anxious to get out of here. And their boss is on"
" the run, too, if what they say is true..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "344"
msgid ""
"So in the end, they hadn't even taken anything from me? What a weird scam..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "368"
msgid "You got 8,000 EXP."
msgstr ""

